# ============================================================================
# m20-map-server-kick.service —— 开机后重发一次地图 latch(配对 .timer)
#                                one post-boot map re-latch (paired .timer)
# ============================================================================
# 狗的开机风暴期存在 DDS 配对疾病(wedged writer / deaf reader,rsdriver 同款):
# map_server 开机时 latch 的 /GRID_MAP 可能没送到 OEM 消费者,而事后新读者能收到
# (2026-08-12 实测:探针收到 latch,导航侧没收到,人工重发即通)。
# 修法与人工一致:等风暴平息后重启 map_server 一次 —— 新 writer 重新 latch,
# 此时所有消费者都已在线,走活跃 reliable 路径送达。
#
# The robot's boot storm carries a DDS pairing disease (wedged writer / deaf
# reader — same family as rsdriver's): the /GRID_MAP latched at boot may never
# reach the OEM consumer even though later readers receive it fine (measured
# 2026-08-12: probe got the latch, nav side did not, a manual re-send fixed
# it). The automated fix mirrors the manual one: restart map_server once after
# the storm settles — a fresh writer re-latches to the now-present consumers.
[Unit]
Description=M20 map re-latch after boot (one-shot kick)

[Service]
Type=oneshot
ExecStart=/bin/systemctl try-restart m20-map-server.service
